          "title": "You'll want to know: راستگو",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "راستگو — rostgu — \"honest\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "rostgu is rost, \"true\" (a form of râst), with -gu, \"saying\" (from goftan, \"to say\"): truth-teller. Both are inherited Persian words."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
